Hi Neil,
Your nmisc package would need to be on one of our supported repos.  The easiest way may be to put it on github, and then install the package through devtools::install_github() on your local machine and you can then re-deploy it.
shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> would be able to download the repo and build it at that point, unless it is a private repo in which case there is an extra step you can take to get it all to work.

-Tareef

