Hi Andy,

I was referencing zipdata in my UI.R, but I thought that having it in global.r would allow it to be read from both ui.r and server.r. Is this not correct?

Anyways, I added it explicitly to the ui.r and now it runs successfully!

Thanks for your help.

Best,
Sarah

